cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PulseCrawl or its research benchmark, cite this software artifact."
title: "PulseCrawl: Design and Evaluation of a Framework for Policy-Constrained Recurring Web Crawling and Versioned Structured Datasets"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PulseCrawl contributors"
version: "0.3.0"
license: "AGPL-3.0-only"
abstract: >-
  A framework for policy-constrained recurring web crawling, structured
  extraction, and versioned Parquet datasets, with explicit request policies,
  durable safety invariants, URL-scoped template cascades, and a reproducible
  comparative evaluation.
keywords:
  - web crawling
  - web scraping
  - distributed systems
  - data lake
  - information extraction
repository-code: "https://github.com/pulsecrawl/PulseCrawl"
